Samples (CC0): FreePats project (freepats.zenvoid.org), Karoryfer Samples / sfzinstruments, VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios), Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios)

Sound effects (mix.py)
- All foley and ambience synthesized procedurally with numpy/scipy (pen on paper, wet brush, water jar, footsteps, bicycle chain and tyre, bicycle bell, bamboo lid, steam, birds, street murmur). No recordings.

No voice, no subtitles, no downloaded footage or images.
